  Changelog
 ===========
 
+- Tables can now be created using SQLite's ``STRICT`` mode by passing
+  ``strict=True`` to the Python APIs or ``--strict`` to the relevant CLI
+  commands. The new ``table.strict`` property identifies strict tables.
+
 .. _v3_19:
 
